  "bodyHash": "d4d818c7a7b27ea5",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" width=\"836\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Buy Me a Coffee&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Become a Patron&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=Join Our Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Join Our Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Wiki&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\"> </a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes 将投票中被忽视和遗忘的生物加入游戏。主要目标之一是进一步扩展原始概念，并为所有生物添加新的原版风格特性。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">wiki</a> 以了解已实现的生物和功能的详细信息。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:33px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"Crab\" width=\"60\">&nbsp;&nbsp;螃蟹</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a>，一种在红树林沼泽和海滩上漫步的友好生物。想要延伸你的攻击距离吗？蟹钳可以用来制作一种增加你攻击范围的药水，为你的冒险提供宝贵的优势。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 这只小家伙，你需要海带和耐心，因为螃蟹需要将它们的卵\"埋\"在安全的地方。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" alt=\"Waving Crab\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" alt=\"Crab climbing a mangrove tree\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">与螃蟹相关的其他特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\" rel=\"nofollow\">蟹钳</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\" rel=\"nofollow\">延伸</a> 状态效果</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:41px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"Tuff Golem\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;凝灰岩傀儡</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一座雕像般的生物，可以手持并展示你给予它的任何物品，但小心它在不睡觉的时候喜欢来一场即兴散步。想让凝灰岩傀儡待原地不动？用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a> 把它固定住。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a> 这位沉睡的美人，收集一个凝灰石块、任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\" rel=\"nofollow\">颜色</a> 的羊毛块和一个南瓜。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"Tuff Golem holding enchanted book\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"Sleeping Tuff Golems\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"Rascal\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;捣蛋鬼</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">发现 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\" rel=\"nofollow\">捣蛋鬼</a>，一种在矿井中嬉戏的顽皮小生物，热衷于捉迷藏游戏。它既顽皮又乐于助人，在寻找它时会给你提示。找到它三次，它将奖励你梦寐以求的物资包！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" alt=\"Rascal in the mines\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" alt=\"Rascal throwing out the bundle\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"Copper Golem\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;铜傀儡</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">认识 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">铜傀儡</a>，一种袖珍的喜剧性 marvel，喜欢在随机按下铜按钮中寻找乐趣。与其他任何铜制品一样，它会随时间 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\" rel=\"nofollow\">氧化</a>，但别担心，维护非常简单！想要快速焕新外观，用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\" rel=\"nofollow\">斧头</a> 刮一下或用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a> 上蜡即可。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a> 这只小生物，收集一个铜块、一个南瓜和一根避雷针。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"Copper Golem Workstation structure in the village\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"Copper Golems\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">与铜傀儡相关的其他特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\" rel=\"nofollow\">铜傀儡工作站</a> 村庄结构</li>\n<li>所有铜变体的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\" rel=\"nofollow\">铜按钮</a></li>\n<li>所有铜变体的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\" rel=\"nofollow\">避雷针</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"Glare\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;瞪眼怪</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\" rel=\"nofollow\">瞪眼怪</a>，一种生活在茂密洞穴中、性格古怪可爱的苔藓伙伴，它讨厌黑暗。你也讨厌黑暗吗？如果是的话，瞪眼怪可以为你显示足够黑暗以供怪物生成的区域。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\" rel=\"nofollow\">驯服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 这只小可爱，你需要 glow berries（发光浆果），但小心，瞪眼怪倾向于经常啃食它们，不留任何剩余。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" alt=\"Baby and adult Glare\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" alt=\"Flying Glare in the lush caves\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"Iceologer\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;冰法师</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">遭遇 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰法师</a>，一个住在深雪中的孤独灾厄村民。你可以通过在树林中寻找一座小型云杉 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">小屋</a> 来找到他。但冒险时小心，多年的野外生活让他的心比周围的冰还要冰冷。如果他发现你，准备迎接 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">寒冰攻击</a>，让你的冒险变成一场霜冻挑战。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" alt=\"Iceologer Cabin in the snows\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" alt=\"Iceologer attacking the villager\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">与冰法师相关的其他特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰法师小屋</a> 结构</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\" rel=\"nofollow\">冻结图腾</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"Moobloom\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;花牛</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\" rel=\"nofollow\">花牛</a>，一种沐浴阳光的奶牛，身上覆盖着美丽的花朵，主要生活在花海森林中。这些被花朵覆盖的伙伴不仅赏心悦目，还与蜜蜂有着和谐的协同关系。当它们穿越时，花牛会留下一串绽放的 Flora，让每一步都成为穿越自然奇观的迷人旅程。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" alt=\"Buttercup Mooblooms\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" alt=\"Flowery Mooblooms\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">与花牛相关的其他特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\" rel=\"nofollow\">毛茛</a> 花朵</li>\n<li>所有木材变体的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\" rel=\"nofollow\">养蜂人区域</a> 村庄结构</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">养蜂人</a> 村民职业</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"Wildfire\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;烈焰王</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">烈焰王</a>， Blaze（烈焰人）的主宰，受到四面盾牌的守护。这次相遇并不友好，小心它的盾牌碎片弹幕和撼动大地的震波攻击。被逼入绝境时，它会召唤烈焰人为其增援。在这个 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">要塞</a> 领地里，运用策略征服这场挑战吧。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" alt=\"Citadel structure in the nether\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" alt=\"Wildfire in the citadel\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">与烈焰王相关的其他特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">要塞</a> 结构</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\" rel=\"nofollow\">烈焰王冠</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\" rel=\"nofollow\">烈焰王冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"Mauler\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;吞噬者（大饥荒）</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\" rel=\"nofollow\">吞噬者</a>，一种在稀树草原、恶地沙漠中漫游的小型掠食者。它们正在追寻鸡、兔子等猎物。你可以用附魔食物喂养它们来 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\" rel=\"nofollow\">储存经验值</a>，之后再用瓶子和提取。但小心，经验值越多，吞噬者就越大越饿！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" alt=\"Maulers hunting the chicken\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" alt=\"Fed Mauler\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"Illusioner\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;幻影法师</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">遭遇 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻影法师</a>，一个手持弓箭、狡诈的骗子，住在针叶林中。你可以通过寻找一座小木屋或他的训练场来找到他。小心接近，因为他的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\" rel=\"nofollow\">致盲术</a> 可能会让你陷入黑暗，难以分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻觉</a> 与现实。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" alt=\"Illusioner Shack in the taiga\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" alt=\"Illusioner in the training grounds\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">与幻影法师相关的其他特性：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻影法师小屋</a> 结构</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象图腾</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"Zombie Horse (Trap)\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;僵尸马（陷阱）</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">曾经想骑 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\" rel=\"nofollow\">僵尸马</a> 吗？如果是，在雷暴期间接近它，奇迹可能会发生 &ndash; 你甚至可能一睹四骑士的真容。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" alt=\"Zombie Horse during thunderstorm\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" alt=\"Four Horsemen during thunderstorm\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 兼容性 / 附加组件</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes 设计为与所有其他模组完全兼容，目前提供以下附加组件和数据包：</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - Flowery Mooblooms</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - Beekeeper Hut</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社区</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 Discord 服务器</a>，畅聊、分享你的作品、提问，或者仅仅了解模组的最新开发动态，并在新版本发布时收到通知。也请随时通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issues 报告任何崩溃或错误</a>。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支持</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">我会继续以爱好开发我的模组，因为我真心享受这个过程。如果你想支持我，可以在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a> 上进行支持。非常感谢你的支持。</p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 许可证</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组采用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 许可证授权。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎浏览我的代码以了解我在开发此模组过程中如何解决各种挑战的方法。你可以将代码片段融入自己的项目中。也欢迎你在任何模组包中使用此模组（当然，请注明来源/链接回本页面，我们将不胜感激）。</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:18px\">你也可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">blockbench 目录</a>，其中包含所有模型和调色板，以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">纹理目录</a> 中的贴图。欢迎获取灵感，但请不要直接复制粘贴任何内容作为你自己的作品。</p>",
